OL,3,GNEWSARAF base chemical contamination
OL,4,Aworst in UK, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FChemical contamination at a former RAF
OL,7,Fbase earmarked for 9,000 homes is the
OL,8,Fworst found in the UK, a report has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FTesting at RAF Upper Heyford carried
OL,12,Fout on behalf of a developer found
OL,13,F"unacceptable" levels of
OL,14,Fpolyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS),
OL,15,Freferred to as forever chemicals.
OL,17,FFears have been raised previously that
OL,18,Fthe site could be the source of
OL,19,Fpollution in nearby waterways, after
OL,20,Fearlier testing by campaigners and the
OL,21,FEnvironment Agency.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
