OL,3,GNEWSARAF base chemical contamination
OL,4,Aworst in UK, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoughly 1300 homes have already been
OL,7,Fbuilt on the site. Paul Silver, chief
OL,8,Fexecutive of developer Dorchester
OL,9,FLiving, said separate soil samples
OL,10,Ftaken from residential areas showed the
OL,11,Farea was "safe for use".
